ExplodedService pins a few service promises to an exploded view of the part that service keeps running: a centrifugal pump drawn apart along its shaft on a light drawing sheet, with a leader from three of its parts to the promises.

- Look: `"look": "exploded-service"` on a `grid` block (renderer `assets/src/blocks/look-exploded-service.js`). Fields: `h`, `items [{t, d, icon, link, part}]`; `part` names the part the leader points at: `impeller`, `motor` or `tag` (default in that order). Best for exactly three items.
- Markup: `.aq-exploded-service` › `__fig` (aria-hidden) › `__art` (the `svg.aq-iso.__svg`: sheet, `__axis` centre line, one `g.__piece[data-du]` per part with an IsoKit `aq-iso__part[data-iso-id]` inside, leaders `g[data-lead]` with `__lead`; phone `__pin` numbers) and `ol.__calls` › `li.__call[data-part][data-lead]` (`__code` with `__n` and the icon, `h3.__t` with the link, `__d`), each standing on its leader's shelf.
- The exploded pump is drawn in the renderer from IsoKit primitives (motor with fins and terminal box, adapter and shaft, mechanical seal, back plate, impeller with vanes, O-ring, volute casing, a service tag on its discharge): IsoKit has an assembled pump only.
- Tokens: section ground, lines `line-strong`, sheet furniture `line`, the tag's tick and a lit part in `flow`; titles Geist 24/30, lines 15/24 `ink-muted`, numbers Geist Mono (phone only: on desktop the leaders tie each promise to its part). Pointing at or focusing a promise lights its part and leader.
- Phone (and up to 1040 px, where the promises sit three across under a centred drawing): the sheet is cropped tight to the pump so it reads at full width, numbered pins sit on the leader points, and the promises stack under it with the same numbers.
- Motion: the sheet fades up, the pump draws itself assembled and fills, then the parts slide apart along the shaft (casing first and furthest, each settling) while the centre line draws through them; the leaders run out and the promises stand up on their shelves. Once, about 3.5 s.
